  unitName: "Asahi (6\u2605)"
  unitId: 20785
  unitNumber: 1327
  description: A Hunter cadet from another world. After a short period of time, the
    fate of the young man she had been accompanying suddenly turned for the very
    worst. He was entrusted the unfathomable task of "godslaying" by the demon he
    had made a pact with, and was forced to carry it out. As battles grew even more
    intense, Asahi grew frustrated with herself after realizing her own powerlessness.
    It is said that the path of action she chose to follow was what ultimately guided
    her companion to choose his own.
  summonDesc: Ugh, I can't wait until people consider me a real Hunter.
  fusionDesc: I did it!<br>Now I've also become an official Hunter!
  evoDesc: What can I do to help?<br>I want to lend Nanashi a hand...
  element: 2
  rarity: 5
